Data and third-party materials (NOT covered by the MIT license above)

The MIT license covers the CODE in this repository (src/, tests/, build
scripts) and the author's ORIGINAL derived data and figures. The underlying
data carry their own terms:

- SEC EDGAR filings (Form N-PORT, S-1/424B) underlying data/ are U.S.
  Government works in the public domain.
- Forge Global / Forge Data LLC figures (the FPMI index level and trailing
  returns, and the per-company secondary estimates) are cited with attribution
  as inputs to the author's derived metrics. They are NOT relicensed here and
  remain the property of Forge Data LLC.
- Prediction-market readings (Polymarket, Kalshi) and headline rounds are
  public facts, each cited with its source and date in data/.
- The author's own derived datasets (the company-quarter panel, the gap and
  cross-fund-spread metrics, the coverage table) may be reused under
  CC BY 4.0 with attribution to this working paper.

Full provenance and the operating standard are in notes/compliance_audit.md.
